Data availability and reuse
The files contain bibliographic/search-export material, not patient-level clinical data. Availability in this repository does not imply that third-party bibliographic metadata, abstracts, or database exports are freely redistributable under an open license. Users are responsible for complying with applicable source-database terms and citation requirements.

